+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Implementation
+
+- [x] 1.1 Add `JsonPatchError` and export it from `src/index.ts`
+- [x] 1.2 Add safe deep clone and safe member-set helpers (own `__proto__` as ordinary key)
+- [x] 1.3 Add JSON equality, patch/operation validation and pointer-to-parent/last-token navigation reusing `parsePointer`
+- [x] 1.4 Implement `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, `test` and export `applyPatch(document, patch)`
+
+## 2. Tests (`npm test`)
+
+- [x] 2.1 Tests for the applyPatch contract: no mutation, no aliasing, empty patch, atomic failure
+- [x] 2.2 Tests for patch validation scenarios (non-array, bad ops, missing value/from, null value, extra members, bad pointers)
+- [x] 2.3 Tests for `add` scenarios (object, array insert/append, array errors, missing parent, root, escaped/empty keys)
+- [x] 2.4 Tests for `remove` and `replace` scenarios, including root and `-`
+- [x] 2.5 Tests for `move` and `copy` scenarios (arrays, prefix rule, same location, deep copy)
+- [x] 2.6 Tests for `test` scenarios (equality edge cases, missing target, root, abort)
+- [x] 2.7 Tests for hostile keys (`__proto__`, inherited names)
+- [x] 2.8 Run `npm test` and confirm everything passes
